You keep telling me
what you're not gonna do,

1740
02:39:34,199 --> 02:39:36,574
I'm gonna show you what I am going to.

1741
02:39:41,699 --> 02:39:43,699
Now you enjoy this concert.

1742
02:39:55,408 --> 02:39:56,408
PAGON: We have a problem.

1743
02:39:57,324 --> 02:39:58,324
Oh, yeah?

1744
02:39:58,408 --> 02:39:59,491
What's that?

1745
02:39:59,574 --> 02:40:02,533
Take a look around, G.
There's a reason G'iah isn't here with us.

1746
02:40:03,866 --> 02:40:05,116
She's the mole.

1747
02:40:05,866 --> 02:40:07,491
I've already taken care of her.

1748
02:40:07,866 --> 02:40:08,949
PAGON: Yes, sir.

1749
