the greatest mistake.

1804
02:44:57,616 --> 02:45:00,574
I lost all my reason to be your husband.

1805
02:45:03,866 --> 02:45:08,074
Ignored every signal
in my head, heart and body

1806
02:45:08,158 --> 02:45:11,283
that screamed, "Stop!"

1807
02:45:16,616 --> 02:45:18,991
Even now, as I sit here,

1808
02:45:19,074 --> 02:45:23,283
knowing you plan to kill me
with that pistol of yours,

1809
02:45:26,824 --> 02:45:30,241
I don't know that if I had a chance
to do it over again,

1810
02:45:30,324 --> 02:45:32,116
that I'd do anything different.

1811
02:45:50,949 --> 02:45:53,949
Would you tell me the story? About how you

1812
02:45:56,033 --> 02:45:57,241
chose her?

1813
02:46:02,658 --> 02:46:06,158
Dr. Priscilla Davis
had a congenital heart defect.

1814
02:46:06,241 --> 02:46:08,158
She was keeping it a secret.

1815
02:46:09,324 --> 02:46:13,366
Didn't want the people she loved
gathered around for months,

1816
02:46:14,324 --> 02:46:16,074
watching her die in a hospital.

1817
02:46:16,949 --> 02:46:20,574
And I would visit her in her room
almost every day towards the end,

1818
02:46:21,199 --> 02:46:22,908
and we became quite close.

1819
02:46:24,116 --> 02:46:25,491
But at some point,

1820
02:46:26,324 --> 02:46:28,158
I had to acknowledge the truth of

1821
