that I would bury her at sea, which I did.

1836
02:47:22,449 --> 02:47:23,491
Two,

1837
02:47:24,949 --> 02:47:27,491
that I would continue
to be a daughter to her parents.

1838
02:47:28,199 --> 02:47:29,949
- Which you've also done.
- Mmm-hmm.

1839
02:47:35,366 --> 02:47:36,449
Three?

1840
