That I would never hurt you.

1841
02:47:46,866 --> 02:47:48,158
Sorry, darling.

1842
02:47:48,658 --> 02:47:49,783
(SIGHS)

1843
02:47:55,949 --> 02:47:57,699
"And did you get

1844
