"And what did you want?"

1847
02:48:17,491 --> 02:48:19,491
"To call myself beloved."

1848
02:48:23,741 --> 02:48:26,658
- "To feel myself...
- "Myself...

1849
02:48:27,158 --> 02:48:32,866
-"...beloved on the earth"
-"...beloved on the earth."

1850
02:48:33,199 --> 02:48:34,408
(GUNS FIRE)

