my favorite liquid lunch with you.

1869
02:50:47,158 --> 02:50:49,199
{\an8}Pappy Van Winkle.

1870
02:50:49,824 --> 02:50:53,074
{\an8}Twenty-three years
of distilled perfection.

1871
