that's Gravik.

1913
02:53:22,491 --> 02:53:23,658
(CHUCKLES)

1914
02:53:23,741 --> 02:53:24,949
Come on.

1915
02:53:25,074 --> 02:53:27,783
Is that really what you're gonna go with
at your trial?

1916
