threatening me.

1927
02:53:55,908 --> 02:53:58,158
But what I can have
is the rest of this Pappy,

1928
02:53:58,241 --> 02:54:00,574
'cause, baby, this is fire.

1929
02:54:01,199 --> 02:54:03,658
Now, why don't you hobble
your ancient ass on out of here

1930
02:54:03,741 --> 02:54:05,491
