Vladimir, not John.

1944
02:55:19,366 --> 02:55:21,908
"When you find flesh, you push.

1945
02:55:23,158 --> 02:55:25,574
"When you find steel, you stop."

1946
02:55:26,241 --> 02:55:27,699
