AGENT: Yes, sir.

1957
02:56:02,908 --> 02:56:04,033
Get the door.

1958
02:56:06,616 --> 02:56:07,783
Giddy up.

1959
02:56:36,199 --> 02:56:40,366
We're in transit to the summit.
Citadel is in position number four.

1960
02:56:45,533 --> 02:56:46,824
(SPEAKING IN RUSSIAN)

1961
02:57:18,658 --> 02:57:20,366
AGENT 1: Two o'clock!
AGENT 2: Incoming!

1962
02:57:20,616 --> 02:57:21,656
AGENT 3: Fire! Fire! Fire!

1963
02:57:23,449 --> 02:57:24,529
AGENT 4: Go ahead and fire!

1964
02:57:24,574 --> 02:57:26,408
Confirm, Citadel is alive.

1965
02:57:30,741 --> 02:57:33,116
AGENT 3: <i>I repeat, Citadel is alive.</i>
AGENT 4: This way!

1966
02:57:35,324 --> 02:57:37,408
AGENT 5: Enemy in sight!
AGENT 6: Taking heavy fire.

1967
02:57:42,533 --> 02:57:45,199
(YELLING IN RUSSIAN)

1968
02:57:47,033 --> 02:57:49,074
(IN ENGLISH) No question,
it's the Russians!

1969
02:57:49,158 --> 02:57:51,199
AGENT 1: Watch your six.
AGENT 2: Cover!

1970
02:58:04,866 --> 02:58:06,116
(ALL SCREAMING)

1971
02:58:06,741 --> 02:58:08,324
(YELLING IN RUSSIAN)

1972
02:58:08,408 --> 02:58:10,033
(IN ENGLISH) The Russians are advancing!

1973
02:58:10,116 --> 02:58:11,241
AGENT 3: Get down!

1974
02:58:15,908 --> 02:58:17,116
(ALL SCREAMING)

1975
02:58:21,033 --> 02:58:22,366
(YELLING IN RUSSIAN)

1976
02:58:22,449 --> 02:58:23,949
AGENT 1: Go! Ten o'clock.

1977
02:58:24,408 --> 02:58:25,824
AGENT 2: Watch the chopper!

1978
02:58:25,908 --> 02:58:28,199
AGENT 3: Two and twelve.
Two and twelve. Advance.

1979
02:58:28,283 --> 02:58:30,366
(GRUNTING)

1980
02:58:30,783 --> 02:58:32,449
Bloody hell, Fury. It's a kill zone.

1981
02:58:32,533 --> 02:58:35,408
Whole planet will be a kill zone
if we don't save Ritson.

1982
02:58:35,491 --> 02:58:37,491
(YELLING IN RUSSIAN)

1983
02:58:38,991 --> 02:58:40,949
AGENT 5: (IN ENGLISH) Fire! Fire! Fire!

1984
02:58:42,366 --> 02:58:43,908
(SPEAKING IN RUSSIAN)

1985
02:58:51,366 --> 02:58:53,491
(GRAVIK YELLING IN RUSSIAN)

1986
02:59:07,324 --> 02:59:08,741
AGENT 1: Defend Citadel!

1987
02:59:08,866 --> 02:59:10,074
Move!

1988
02:59:10,158 --> 02:59:11,616
AGENT 2: Fury inbound.

1989
02:59:11,699 --> 02:59:12,824
AGENT 4: Ten o'clock!

1990
02:59:13,783 --> 02:59:14,783
(GROANS)

1991
02:59:19,366 --> 02:59:20,783
Fury's here.

1992
02:59:24,074 --> 02:59:25,283
Cover the Stagecoach!

1993
02:59:25,366 --> 02:59:26,449
AGENT 5: Take this mag!

1994
02:59:27,741 --> 02:59:28,741
AGENT 6: South side!

1995
02:59:29,033 --> 02:59:30,033
Go! Go! Go! Go! Go!

1996
02:59:30,908 --> 02:59:32,033
(SCREAMS)

1997
02:59:32,116 --> 02:59:33,408
(GROANS)

1998
02:59:39,408 --> 02:59:40,533
(GROANS)

1999
02:59:40,616 --> 02:59:41,783
SOLDIER 1: Fury. Fury's here.

2000
02:59:46,616 --> 02:59:49,033
- Reinforcements here, sir.
- Fury.

2001
02:59:49,283 --> 02:59:50,783
- Cover up!
- More men coming, sir!

2002
02:59:50,866 --> 02:59:52,491
FURY: Move! Move! Move!

2003
02:59:53,074 --> 02:59:55,366
AGENT 3:
Get to the president's car.

2004
02:59:55,449 --> 02:59:57,241
AGENT 4: Go, go, go!
AGENT 5: Hold the line.

2005
02:59:58,699 --> 03:00:01,574
AGENT 6: <i>Requesting backup.
Repeat, requesting backup.</i>

2006
03:00:01,658 --> 03:00:02,699
SOLDIER 1: Let's go!

2007
03:00:02,783 --> 03:00:03,866
SOLDIER 2: Sniper!

2008
03:00:04,616 --> 03:00:06,116
FURY: Mr. President? Sir?

2009
03:00:06,908 --> 03:00:08,866
- He's out.
- I've got this. Stand back, man.

2010
03:00:14,824 --> 03:00:17,741
- (BOTH GROANING)
- AGENT 1: Reinforcements now!

2011
03:00:17,824 --> 03:00:19,949
Take care of Talos. Now!

2012
03:00:25,824 --> 03:00:26,824
(GROANS)

2013
03:00:32,408 --> 03:00:33,408
(GROANS)

2014
03:00:41,533 --> 03:00:43,199
SOLDIER 1: The Russians are still coming!

2015
03:00:43,283 --> 03:00:44,908
SOLDIER 2: Russians, two o'clock!

2016
03:00:46,533 --> 03:00:47,949
They're still advancing!

2017
03:00:53,491 --> 03:00:54,574
(GRUNTS)

2018
03:00:56,658 --> 03:00:58,949
He's a bloody alien.
He's trying to get to Ritson!

2019
03:00:59,033 --> 03:01:01,616
No, no, no! Hold your fire! He's with me.

2020
03:01:02,116 --> 03:01:04,533
- He's with us.
- SOLDIER 1: Where are those helos?

2021
03:01:06,116 --> 03:01:07,116
(GRUNTS)

2022
03:01:09,241 --> 03:01:11,449
(GRUNTING)

2023
03:01:13,449 --> 03:01:14,449
(GROANS)

2024
03:01:14,533 --> 03:01:17,783
AGENT 1: <i>Alpha, Bravo, Tango,
get those choppers in here, now!</i>

2025
03:01:21,574 --> 03:01:23,241
SOLDIER 1: Reclaim your positions.

2026
03:01:27,491 --> 03:01:28,783
SOLDIER 2: Where are they?

2027
03:01:31,033 --> 03:01:32,158
(BREATHING HEAVILY)

2028
03:01:32,241 --> 03:01:33,366
(FURY GRUNTS)

2029
03:01:33,699 --> 03:01:36,033
AGENT 2: President's
out of the vehicle!

2030
03:01:37,366 --> 03:01:38,699
Cover the President!

2031
03:01:40,074 --> 03:01:42,449
Talos, hang in there.
I'll be back for you.

2032
03:01:44,616 --> 03:01:46,366
(MEN GRUNTING)

2033
03:01:47,116 --> 03:01:49,283
- Put him in my car.
- I got my own ride.

2034
03:01:49,866 --> 03:01:51,074
(ENGINE STARTS)

2035
03:01:52,533 --> 03:01:53,949
Come on, I've got you.

2036
03:01:56,074 --> 03:01:57,116
I got you.

2037
03:01:58,074 --> 03:02:00,408
Come on. I got you.

2038
03:02:05,866 --> 03:02:07,033
SOLDIER 1: Fire!

2039
03:02:07,116 --> 03:02:08,324
SOLDIER 2: I'm hit.

2040
03:02:10,658 --> 03:02:11,741
Put him down.

2041
03:02:14,699 --> 03:02:19,241
I said put him down, now!

2042
03:02:23,741 --> 03:02:25,116
(GRUNTS)

2043
03:02:25,824 --> 03:02:26,824
(GROANS)

2044
03:02:31,574 --> 03:02:33,116
No!

2045
03:02:40,408 --> 03:02:42,116
SOLDIER 1:
Reinforcements are here!

2046
03:02:42,199 --> 03:02:43,824
SOLDIER 2: Here they come, lads!

2047
03:05:59,296 --> 03:06:11,296
<font color="#00ff00">{\an8}Downloaded From MoviesMod.org</font>

2048
03:06:05,901 --> 03:06:07,276
He's building a machine.

2049
03:06:07,734 --> 03:06:08,734
What kind of machine?

2050
03:06:08,901 --> 03:06:10,818
BROGAN: <i>I think
it's to make us stronger.</i>

2051
03:06:11,026 --> 03:06:12,234
Now, at the council meeting,

2052
03:06:12,318 --> 03:06:14,901
I told you I had a plan
for taking Earth as our own.

2053
03:06:15,401 --> 03:06:17,068
The heroes of Earth will react.

2054
03:06:17,609 --> 03:06:21,026
The only way we can counter that
is to become super ourselves.

2055
03:06:21,568 --> 03:06:22,568
Super Skrulls.

2056
03:06:22,651 --> 03:06:24,234
Who's leading the science?

2057
03:06:25,568 --> 03:06:27,234
Dalton. The name's Dalton.

2058
03:06:27,318 --> 03:06:29,234
(BREATHING HEAVILY)

2059
03:06:30,318 --> 03:06:33,693
RHODEY: <i>One of the two occupants
of that lovely country manor of yours</i>

2060
03:06:34,109 --> 03:06:35,484
<i>is catching a bullet today.</i>

2061
03:06:35,568 --> 03:06:37,068
You can flip a coin for all I care.

2062
03:06:37,443 --> 03:06:38,443
(GUNSHOT)

2063
03:06:41,068 --> 03:06:42,443
FURY: They'll be coming for you.

2064
03:06:42,693 --> 03:06:45,276
I'm dealing with my own infiltration
at the moment.

2065
03:06:47,318 --> 03:06:51,776
(SOFTLY) There are Skrulls
inside the U.S. government.

2066
03:06:54,276 --> 03:06:55,276
(GROANS)

2067
03:07:12,109 --> 03:07:14,109
We need to start
pounding blood transfusions.

2068
03:07:14,193 --> 03:07:15,359
There's a cooler in the OR.

2069
03:07:15,443 --> 03:07:17,109
Mr. President, can you hear me?

2070
03:07:17,193 --> 03:07:18,484
Sir, you need to make a space.

2071
03:07:18,568 --> 03:07:20,818
- This was not the Russians. It was not.
- Sir.

2072
03:07:21,568 --> 03:07:23,526
I'll crack his chest,
you take the laparotomy.

2073
03:07:23,609 --> 03:07:24,710
You think he can tolerate it?

2074
03:07:24,734 --> 03:07:27,276
Whatever you do,
do not trust Colonel Rhodes.

2075
03:07:27,359 --> 03:07:29,568
NURSE: His pulse is dropping.
SURGEON: Let's go.

2076
03:07:29,651 --> 03:07:31,151
Sir, do you have clearance?

2077
03:07:31,734 --> 03:07:32,901
Then stay outside.

2078
03:07:32,984 --> 03:07:34,335
REPORTER ON TV:
<i>In a bizarre twist,</i>

2079
03:07:34,359 --> 03:07:36,401
<i>President Ritson was rescued
from the assault</i>

2080
03:07:36,484 --> 03:07:40,276
<i>by what eyewitnesses describe
as a shapeshifting alien.</i>

2081
03:07:40,484 --> 03:07:43,276
<i>As we stand by for news
regarding the status...</i>

2082
03:08:24,318 --> 03:08:26,318
(INDISTINCT CHATTER)

2083
03:08:34,526 --> 03:08:36,109
Assemble the operatives.

2084
03:08:53,526 --> 03:08:55,193
You should be proud, G.

2085
03:08:55,651 --> 03:08:58,318
- Talos is finally...
- GRAVIK: What? Dead?

2086
03:08:58,859 --> 03:09:01,526
Our target was the President,
and he's still alive.

2087
03:09:02,026 --> 03:09:03,609
- We don't know that yet.
- GRAVIK: No.

2088
03:09:03,693 --> 03:09:07,068
But what we know
is our war is yet to be set in motion.

2089
03:09:07,151 --> 03:09:10,026
And if you'd have stolen
what you were supposed to,

2090
03:09:10,234 --> 03:09:12,484
I could've taken out the convoy
single-handed.

2091
03:09:12,568 --> 03:09:13,568
But would you?

2092
03:09:14,234 --> 03:09:18,693
You ordered Fury's death
when you knew Varra would never do it.

2093
03:09:19,484 --> 03:09:23,193
You had another chance to kill Fury today,
and you didn't take it.

2094
03:09:24,068 --> 03:09:25,693
Because he has what we need.

2095
03:09:26,193 --> 03:09:27,818
Explain it to us.

2096
03:09:28,359 --> 03:09:30,901
You told me Fury hid the Avengers' DNA,

2097
03:09:30,984 --> 03:09:33,818
but it wasn't in any of the locations
you provided.

2098
03:09:35,484 --> 03:09:37,151
No, Fury never trusted you,

2099
03:09:37,234 --> 03:09:41,276
and it makes me start to wonder
why should we... (GROANS)

2100
03:09:43,859 --> 03:09:44,901
(GASPS)

2101
03:09:50,318 --> 03:09:52,026
GRAVIK: Pagon thought he had a voice,

2102
03:09:52,693 --> 03:09:53,734
but none of you do.

2103
03:09:54,234 --> 03:09:55,443
You're faceless

2104
03:09:56,318 --> 03:09:57,943
and you're nameless.

2105
03:09:58,651 --> 03:10:01,109
And the only reason
Fury was on that motorway

2106
03:10:01,193 --> 03:10:04,984
was because his traitor wife
defied my direct order.

2107
03:10:06,193 --> 03:10:07,443
Do you understand?

2108
03:10:08,526 --> 03:10:12,026
Well, then you send some of our people
to Varra's house and kill her.

2109
03:10:14,193 --> 03:10:16,193
(INDISTINCT CHATTER)

2110
03:10:32,484 --> 03:10:33,984
(LINE RINGING)

2111
03:10:39,568 --> 03:10:40,734
RHODEY: <i>Yeah?</i>

2112
03:10:41,193 --> 03:10:42,276
Where are you?

2113
03:10:43,026 --> 03:10:45,943
On my way to the hospital,
to make our outcome favorable.

2114
03:10:46,526 --> 03:10:47,568
Change of plans.

2115
03:10:48,151 --> 03:10:49,693
<i>Keep Ritson alive.</i>

2116
03:10:50,609 --> 03:10:53,193
<i>Make sure he knows
it wasn't just the Russians who did this.</i>

2117
03:10:53,318 --> 03:10:55,276
<i>It was the Russians
with the help of Skrulls.</i>

2118
03:10:55,401 --> 03:10:56,943
(SCOFFS) What?

2119
03:10:57,234 --> 03:10:59,734
Show him satellite footage
of New Skrullos.

2120
03:11:00,318 --> 03:11:02,943
<i>Prove to him there are Skrulls
living here in Russia,</i>

2121
03:11:03,943 --> 03:11:05,818
and that they must all be eliminated.

2122
03:11:06,568 --> 03:11:10,734
- Gravik, have you lost your damn mind?
<i>- No. This is leverage, Raava.</i>

2123
03:11:11,693 --> 03:11:15,568
Fury doesn't wanna see World War III,
or to see innocent Skrulls die.

2124
03:11:15,859 --> 03:11:16,859
<i>Let me handle him.</i>

2125
03:11:17,651 --> 03:11:19,526
And if we don't get what we want?

2126
03:11:19,901 --> 03:11:22,234
Well, then we all do
what we've prepared for.

2127
03:11:23,026 --> 03:11:24,193
Sacrifice.

2128
03:11:30,026 --> 03:11:31,318
Where's the President?

2129
03:11:31,818 --> 03:11:34,276
(SIGHS) Damn people,
giving out classified information.

2130
03:11:34,359 --> 03:11:35,984
Lock this whole place down right now.

2131
03:11:37,318 --> 03:11:38,318
Unbelievable.

2132
03:11:39,734 --> 03:11:43,609
Whoa, whoa, whoa!
Okay, okay. Calm down. Calm down.

2133
03:11:43,693 --> 03:11:45,109
FURY: Do something! I dare you.

2134
03:11:45,193 --> 03:11:46,943
Stand down. Stand down.

2135
03:11:48,276 --> 03:11:50,276
Fury's just very excited to see me.

2136
03:11:51,984 --> 03:11:53,401
Listen... (CHUCKLES)

2137
03:11:53,484 --> 03:11:56,776
The country appreciates your service
to the President tonight,

2138
03:11:57,484 --> 03:11:58,859
but I'm here now. You can go.

2139
03:11:58,943 --> 03:12:00,776
You must be outta your Skrull-ass mind,

2140
03:12:00,859 --> 03:12:03,943
you think I'm gonna let you
get anywhere near the President.

2141
03:12:04,734 --> 03:12:08,193
Well, in order to out me, Nick,
you're gonna have to kill me.

2142
03:12:09,068 --> 03:12:12,026
And you don't wanna kill me
because you're not ready to die.

2143
03:12:13,276 --> 03:12:17,693
But being as I'm not one
to pull a gun and not use it,

2144
03:12:18,484 --> 03:12:20,276
let me give you a little heads-up.

2145
03:12:21,234 --> 03:12:22,818
In about sixty seconds,

2146
03:12:23,484 --> 03:12:25,526
the footage of you killing Maria Hill

2147
03:12:25,609 --> 03:12:29,651
is gonna lead off every news program
all across the hemisphere.

2148
03:12:30,693 --> 03:12:31,859
That's right.

2149
03:12:32,568 --> 03:12:37,443
And you're gonna become the most wanted
and hated man on the planet.

2150
03:12:37,526 --> 03:12:41,109
- You didn't.
- Oh, yeah, I did.

2151
03:12:41,818 --> 03:12:43,318
I really, really did.

2152
03:12:46,734 --> 03:12:48,193
So tick tock, Nick.

2153
03:12:49,068 --> 03:12:50,068
(GRUNTS)

2154
03:12:57,818 --> 03:12:59,526
RHODEY: Consider this a preview, Nick,

2155
03:12:59,818 --> 03:13:03,151
because if you ever get within
100 yards of the President again,

2156
03:13:03,568 --> 03:13:05,734
I'm gonna make sure
you get the whole show.

2157
03:13:05,818 --> 03:13:06,859
Mmm.

2158
03:13:07,234 --> 03:13:09,776
- Tell Gravik I'm coming for him.
- (CHUCKLES SOFTLY)

2159
03:13:10,484 --> 03:13:11,776
Tell him yourself.

2160
03:15:22,818 --> 03:15:24,109
{\an8}REPORTER ON TV: <i>This just in.</i>

2161
03:15:24,193 --> 03:15:26,026
<i>Former S.H.I.E.L.D. Director,
Nicholas Fury,</i>

2162
03:15:26,109 --> 03:15:29,443
<i>is being sought for the murder
of former S.H.I.E.L.D. Agent Maria Hill</i>

2163
03:15:29,526 --> 03:15:32,609
<i>as officials investigate
Fury's possible involvement</i>

2164
03:15:32,693 --> 03:15:35,443
<i>in the failed attempt
on President Ritson's life.</i>

2165
03:15:35,568 --> 03:15:37,734
ASSISTANT: <i>Sonya Falsworth
here to see you, sir.</i>

2166
03:15:37,818 --> 03:15:39,193
Tell her I'm busy.

2167
03:15:40,193 --> 03:15:42,109
Don't mind me.
I didn't see anything. Promise.

2168
03:15:44,526 --> 03:15:46,651
Good afternoon, Sonya.
Have you heard about this?

2169
03:15:46,734 --> 03:15:48,943
The attack on Ritson? No. Do go on.

2170
03:15:49,026 --> 03:15:51,859
Well, do you really believe
that Skrulls could be amongst us?

2171
03:15:51,943 --> 03:15:55,109
Well, if you ask me, sir,
I think they're bloody everywhere.

2172
03:15:55,984 --> 03:15:57,026
Sonya...

2173
03:15:58,568 --> 03:15:59,859
What are you doing?

2174
03:15:59,943 --> 03:16:02,484
Politely asking the location
of Dr. Rosa Dalton.

2175
03:16:02,568 --> 03:16:04,151
Have you lost your mind, woman?

2176
03:16:04,859 --> 03:16:06,276
- (GUNSHOT)
- Argh!

2177
03:16:08,734 --> 03:16:09,859
SIS OFFICER: Ms. Falsworth.

2178
03:16:09,943 --> 03:16:10,943
What have you done?

2179
03:16:11,526 --> 03:16:13,693
Just showing
Director Weatherby's true colors.

2180
03:16:13,776 --> 03:16:15,068
Come on, look at that.

2181
03:16:15,276 --> 03:16:16,568
(GROANS)

2182
03:16:16,943 --> 03:16:20,609
I must inform you that the SIS
has no official policy on killing Skrulls.

2183
03:16:21,318 --> 03:16:24,318
So unless you want me to enact
my personal preference right now,

2184
03:16:24,526 --> 03:16:25,818
you should start talking.

2185
03:16:29,484 --> 03:16:31,234
BETO: <i>Yo, Gravik.
You got a minute?</i>

2186
03:16:32,109 --> 03:16:33,776
What's on your mind, soldier?

2187
03:16:36,359 --> 03:16:37,984
Was just a little confused.

2188
03:16:39,693 --> 03:16:41,318
What are you confused about?

2189
03:16:42,359 --> 03:16:44,651
BETO: Well, Pagon.

2190
03:16:46,568 --> 03:16:47,776
Well, he failed us.

2191
03:16:50,068 --> 03:16:51,068
Oh.

2192
03:16:51,401 --> 03:16:52,776
You scared?

2193
03:16:54,193 --> 03:16:55,609
Yeah, maybe a little.

2194
03:16:56,318 --> 03:16:57,859
(CELL PHONE VIBRATING)

2195
03:17:07,068 --> 03:17:08,318
Speak.

2196
03:17:08,401 --> 03:17:09,734
RHODEY: <i>He's out of surgery.</i>

2197
03:17:10,026 --> 03:17:12,443
Don't worry. I'll handle it.

2198
03:17:13,276 --> 03:17:16,109
<i>Once he's awake,
I'll send confirmation of the strike.</i>

2199
03:17:16,193 --> 03:17:17,193
Yeah.

2200
03:17:18,068 --> 03:17:20,734
Because you know what happens
if you don't, right?

2201
03:17:22,526 --> 03:17:23,776
(GRUNTS)

2202
03:17:51,318 --> 03:17:52,859
(YELLS)

2203
03:17:52,943 --> 03:17:54,068
(GRUNTS)

2204
03:18:03,359 --> 03:18:04,359
(SCREAMS)

2205
03:18:15,193 --> 03:18:16,693
(BETO GROANS)

2206
03:18:24,901 --> 03:18:26,568
(SHOUTS) Who wants it?

2207
03:18:27,526 --> 03:18:28,526
Huh?

2208
03:18:30,026 --> 03:18:31,151
Who else?

2209
03:18:36,443 --> 03:18:38,359
You're nothing but a monster.

2210
03:18:40,859 --> 03:18:42,734
- (GROANS)
- (FEMALE SKRULL SCREAMS)

2211
03:18:50,943 --> 03:18:53,151
(PEOPLE CHATTERING INDISTINCTLY)

2212
03:19:38,068 --> 03:19:40,776
I remember playing beneath this
when I was a kid.

2213
03:19:42,401 --> 03:19:44,151
My father told me what it meant,

2214
03:19:45,401 --> 03:19:46,651
but I've forgotten.

2215
03:19:49,568 --> 03:19:54,651
During World War II,
Nazis practically destroyed this area.

2216
03:19:55,943 --> 03:20:00,484
Afterward, Brixton became a haven
for immigrants from the West Indies.

2217
03:20:02,026 --> 03:20:03,276
This was all they had.

2218
03:20:04,234 --> 03:20:05,943
Is that why you chose this place?

2219
03:20:06,818 --> 03:20:08,734
The path of struggle is steep.

2220
03:20:12,109 --> 03:20:14,276
I feel a lot of strength
when I'm over here.

2221
03:20:15,901 --> 03:20:17,318
Talos did too.

2222
03:20:21,984 --> 03:20:24,359
- Talos died...
- You can stop there.

2223
03:20:27,193 --> 03:20:28,484
He died.

2224
03:20:30,484 --> 03:20:31,943
On a foreign planet.

2225
03:20:33,568 --> 03:20:34,901
On a foreign road.

2226
03:20:37,151 --> 03:20:38,693
Nothing will come of it.

2227
03:20:39,818 --> 03:20:44,151
I ran away from my father
because I knew he would lose.

2228
03:20:44,234 --> 03:20:50,443
Talos chose the path of struggle,
he did not lose.

2229
03:20:51,818 --> 03:20:57,151
You cannot let grief paralyze you, G'iah.
This is your time. Now!

2230
03:21:01,818 --> 03:21:05,401
Talos told me
how you survived your execution.

2231
03:21:08,068 --> 03:21:09,401
I had no other choice.

2232
03:21:11,193 --> 03:21:13,318
What DNA did Gravik steal?

2233
03:21:15,318 --> 03:21:16,984
Only a few samples.

2234
03:21:18,276 --> 03:21:20,151
Cull Obsidian, Flora Colossus.

2235
03:21:20,901 --> 03:21:24,151
But he took those because
he couldn't find what he was looking for.

2236
03:21:24,359 --> 03:21:25,818
What was he looking for?

2237
03:21:26,443 --> 03:21:27,984
Something he called "the Harvest."

2238
03:21:28,318 --> 03:21:30,984
(SIGHS) The Harvest.

2239
03:21:34,693 --> 03:21:36,526
I need to bury my father.

2240
03:21:47,526 --> 03:21:49,776
Take him to Priscilla.
She'll know what to do.

2241
03:21:49,901 --> 03:21:51,526
- (SIRENS APPROACHING)
- Oh, shit.

2242
03:21:51,609 --> 03:21:52,776
I'll be in touch.

2243
03:21:54,151 --> 03:21:56,234
- Where are you going?
- Finland.

2244
03:21:58,401 --> 03:22:00,068
You gonna be all right, kid?

2245
03:22:00,151 --> 03:22:01,318
Don't worry about me.

2246
03:22:02,484 --> 03:22:03,901
I'll put on a good face.

2247
03:22:09,818 --> 03:22:11,401
(SIRENS WAILING)

2248
03:22:12,859 --> 03:22:15,484
(PEOPLE CHATTERING INDISTINCTLY)

2249
03:22:23,776 --> 03:22:24,776
Oh.

2250
03:22:25,151 --> 03:22:26,318
Hello, Skrulls.

2251
03:22:28,734 --> 03:22:29,859
Who are you?

2252
03:22:29,943 --> 03:22:31,609
I think a more apt question would be,

2253
03:22:31,693 --> 03:22:33,276
who would you like me to be?

2254
03:22:33,359 --> 03:22:34,901
I'm staggeringly versatile.

2255
03:22:34,984 --> 03:22:38,026
To give you a couple of examples,
I'm very good at being your bestie.

2256
03:22:38,109 --> 03:22:40,651
I'm also devilishly good
at being not your bestie.

2257
03:22:40,734 --> 03:22:43,234
It's really just a matter of taste.
Cake or death.

2258
03:22:45,026 --> 03:22:48,359
- Get out.
- Now, this is quite the clerical error.

2259
03:22:48,901 --> 03:22:52,234
Nigel, we're going to have to have
someone in admin either fired,

2260
03:22:52,318 --> 03:22:55,734
or, you know, shot, because this
is becoming a bit of a health hazard.

2261
03:22:55,818 --> 03:22:57,359
- No, my name's Victor.
- Of course.

2262
03:22:57,443 --> 03:23:01,359
Nigel's the one with his silencer
pressed against the base of your skull.

2263
03:23:01,651 --> 03:23:03,609
Ooh. There he is.
Would you like to take a seat?

2264
03:23:06,609 --> 03:23:10,109
Now, from these samples I was able
to observe under the microscope,

2265
03:23:10,193 --> 03:23:12,276
you are breaking
quite transgressive ground.

2266
03:23:13,068 --> 03:23:14,234
Would you like to tell me?

2267
03:23:14,318 --> 03:23:17,693
- No, our work here is far too...
- No, not you. Dr. Dalton, you.

2268
03:23:19,651 --> 03:23:21,526
My work is very involved.

2269
03:23:22,484 --> 03:23:25,276
It spans several different areas of focus.

2270
03:23:25,359 --> 03:23:28,068
Ah, well, let's focus on this, shall we?

2271
03:23:36,151 --> 03:23:40,526
Now, start from the very beginning,
and don't miss out a damn decimal point.

2272
03:23:40,984 --> 03:23:42,901
Well Rosa,
this really is a lovely laboratory.

2273
03:23:42,984 --> 03:23:46,068
Unfortunately, I'm going to
have to torch it. You win some, lose some.

2274
03:23:52,568 --> 03:23:53,651
(GRUNTS)

2275
03:23:54,484 --> 03:23:58,526
We'll never betray Gravik.
Let us go or I'll kill her.

2276
03:23:59,234 --> 03:24:00,859
Oh, I don't doubt you for a moment.

2277
03:24:01,193 --> 03:24:03,276
The males in my species are very similar.

2278
03:24:03,359 --> 03:24:06,526
If they're not busy gaslighting you,
they're threatening you with murder.

2279
03:24:06,609 --> 03:24:08,443
That's what all the podcasts are about.

2280
03:24:08,984 --> 03:24:10,318
(SCREAMS)

2281
03:25:01,651 --> 03:25:02,901
Professor Davis?

2282
03:25:40,693 --> 03:25:42,401
You're the one he sent to kill me?

2283
03:25:43,443 --> 03:25:44,526
I'm G'iah.

2284
03:25:48,276 --> 03:25:50,526
Fury said you could help me
bury my father.

2285
03:25:54,359 --> 03:25:55,359
(KNOCK ON DOOR)

2286
03:25:57,526 --> 03:25:59,151
How you feeling, Mr. President?

2287
03:26:00,943 --> 03:26:02,068
Helpless.

2288
03:26:02,484 --> 03:26:04,276
Would you like to change that, sir?

2289
03:26:05,526 --> 03:26:06,609
(DOOR CLOSES)

2290
03:26:06,693 --> 03:26:11,234
As you no doubt saw with your own eyes,
these Skrulls aided in that attack.

2291
03:26:11,443 --> 03:26:12,609
Yeah, I saw.

2292
03:26:13,318 --> 03:26:17,151
But the Skrulls are most definitely here.
And they're working with the Russians.

2293
03:26:18,234 --> 03:26:20,034
Now, of course,
the Russians are denying this,

2294
03:26:20,068 --> 03:26:23,318
but we've received corroborating evidence
from Sonya Falsworth at SIS.

2295
03:26:24,484 --> 03:26:25,776
My God.

2296
03:26:27,526 --> 03:26:31,984
Now, Mr. President, what you see
on this screen is the Skrull compound.

2297
03:26:32,443 --> 03:26:33,818
That's Russian soil.

2298
03:26:35,026 --> 03:26:37,193
We have to neutralize this facility.

2299
03:26:37,484 --> 03:26:39,401
England is 100% behind us,

2300
03:26:39,484 --> 03:26:41,318
as soon as the rest of NATO
sees this proof,

2301
03:26:41,401 --> 03:26:43,151
they're gonna be on board too. Believe me.

2302
03:26:43,484 --> 03:26:45,109
A strike on Russian soil?

2303
03:26:46,526 --> 03:26:48,151
That means World War III.

2304
03:26:49,068 --> 03:26:52,026
I would rather us face a war
than extinction.

2305
03:26:52,109 --> 03:26:54,984
And that's exactly
what a Skrull invasion will mean.

2306
03:26:56,901 --> 03:26:59,193
We have to cut this thing off at the head.

2307
03:26:59,984 --> 03:27:01,068
And now.

2308
03:27:04,984 --> 03:27:07,068
I was wondering when you were gonna call.

2309
03:27:08,193 --> 03:27:10,859
You'd like to think
you're a step ahead of me, Fury.

2310
03:27:11,359 --> 03:27:15,401
Ah. You're a jet, and I need rocket fuel
to stay ahead of you.

2311
03:27:15,609 --> 03:27:16,901
(CHUCKLES)

2312
03:27:17,234 --> 03:27:18,859
I got a deal for you.

2313
03:27:19,484 --> 03:27:21,359
Got anything to do with the Harvest?

2314
03:27:21,943 --> 03:27:24,651
Bring it to me in person,
I'll call the whole thing off.

2315
03:27:25,943 --> 03:27:27,609
FURY: Call what thing off?

2316
03:27:27,693 --> 03:27:29,693
GRAVIK: <i>I thought you were
a step ahead of me.</i>

2317
03:27:29,776 --> 03:27:31,401
<i>I'm raising the stakes, Fury.</i>

2318
03:27:31,859 --> 03:27:35,734
If I don't get what I want,
your President's gonna bomb New Skrullos.

2319
03:27:35,818 --> 03:27:36,901
Then the war is on.

2320
03:27:37,318 --> 03:27:38,984
And bring some iodide pills.

2321
03:27:39,068 --> 03:27:41,818
The reactor room
can be a touch aggressive.

2322
03:27:57,401 --> 03:27:58,443
(SIGHS)

2323
03:28:01,693 --> 03:28:04,359
An Interpol Red Notice. Wow.

2324
03:28:04,443 --> 03:28:06,651
They don't just give those out to anyone.
Kudos.

2325
03:28:06,734 --> 03:28:09,443
Yeah, well, Mama always said
I was special.

2326
03:28:09,526 --> 03:28:10,776
Yeah, Mama was right.

2327
03:28:12,484 --> 03:28:14,943
Feel a lot better
if we were on the Helicarrier.

2328
03:28:15,026 --> 03:28:16,984
Yeah, that's been mothballed.

2329
03:28:17,651 --> 03:28:19,026
A little bit like you should be.

2330
03:28:19,401 --> 03:28:20,401
Oh!

2331
03:28:20,484 --> 03:28:22,859
Before I forget, <i>voilà.</i>

2332
03:28:23,234 --> 03:28:25,318
Figured you might need that
on the other side.

2333
03:28:29,484 --> 03:28:30,484
You're welcome.

2334
03:28:31,401 --> 03:28:35,026
Oh, and try and get a nap.
You seem a little grumpy.

2335
03:28:45,401 --> 03:28:46,818
He was our general.

2336
03:28:48,026 --> 03:28:49,984
He deserves a procession of mourners.

2337
03:28:51,693 --> 03:28:53,776
Talos wasn't much for pageantry.

2338
03:28:58,109 --> 03:28:59,443
Do you have the offering?

2339
03:29:12,484 --> 03:29:13,693
G'IAH: It was my mother's.

2340
03:29:20,734 --> 03:29:21,943
I don't know the prayer.

2341
03:29:24,068 --> 03:29:26,109
It's okay. I know it.

2342
03:29:37,026 --> 03:29:39,026
(SPEAKING SKRULL LANGUAGE)

2343
03:29:49,776 --> 03:29:50,984
{\an8}(IN SKRULL LANGUAGE)

2344
03:30:00,693 --> 03:30:02,651
(IN ENGLISH) I told him he was a failure.

2345
03:30:04,234 --> 03:30:06,651
What kind of daughter
says that to her father?

2346
03:30:07,984 --> 03:30:11,943
The kind that intends to make it up to him
the next time she sees him.

2347
03:30:14,276 --> 03:30:17,443
The last thing I said to Fury
before the Snap was,

2348
03:30:17,526 --> 03:30:21,359
"If you keep spending all your time
chasing aliens,

2349
03:30:21,443 --> 03:30:23,609
"you might lose the one you married."

2350
03:30:24,026 --> 03:30:25,568
(CHUCKLES)

2351
03:30:31,068 --> 03:30:32,818
Why does Gravik want to kill you?

2352
03:30:34,484 --> 03:30:36,026
Insubordination, I guess.

2353
03:30:37,109 --> 03:30:38,818
And yet you decided to obey the order

2354
03:30:38,901 --> 03:30:41,943
that says you have to wait around here
for your execution.

2355
03:30:42,401 --> 03:30:45,484
The thing is, I love this house.

2356
03:30:46,818 --> 03:30:52,359
Loved it ever since I first set foot in it
on a viewing 15 years ago.

2357
03:30:52,443 --> 03:30:53,734
With Fury?

2358
03:30:53,818 --> 03:30:55,068
With Fury in mind.

2359
03:30:55,943 --> 03:30:59,984
I wasn't sure if he'd ever commit
to calling any one place home,

2360
03:31:00,068 --> 03:31:01,901
let alone any place with me.

2361
03:31:02,776 --> 03:31:05,318
But I figured if I was gonna give it
a fighting chance,

2362
03:31:05,401 --> 03:31:09,776
I'd need to find a place that offered
the three things he valued most.

2363
03:31:10,818 --> 03:31:15,943
Lots of privacy, lots of security,
and lots of...

2364
03:31:16,026 --> 03:31:17,068
Leather.

2365
03:31:17,651 --> 03:31:18,818
Light.

2366
03:31:21,484 --> 03:31:24,109
He'd sit there by the window,
reading a book.

2367
03:31:25,068 --> 03:31:27,609
Letting the sun kiss his skin.

2368
03:31:28,151 --> 03:31:32,693
And I'd get lost,
just watching him like that for hours.

2369
03:31:33,068 --> 03:31:35,859
He ever get lost
watching you in your own skin?

2370
03:31:39,318 --> 03:31:41,318
- That's none of your business.
- Well, I...

2371
03:31:42,151 --> 03:31:44,609
- I didn't mean to offend.
- Of course you did.

2372
03:31:44,776 --> 03:31:47,234
You're young,
you think you know everything.

2373
03:31:47,568 --> 03:31:51,151
But you don't know what it takes
to build a life with someone else,

2374
03:31:51,234 --> 03:31:52,651
to sustain it... (EXHALES)

2375
03:32:02,818 --> 03:32:06,651
Anyway, when it comes
to facing down my executioners,

2376
03:32:07,234 --> 03:32:10,734
I'd rather meet the bastards
standing right here in my happiness

2377
03:32:11,526 --> 03:32:14,318
than to meet them
running down some dark alley...

2378
03:32:14,401 --> 03:32:15,901
- (GUNSHOT)
- (G'IAH GASPS)

2379
03:32:24,818 --> 03:32:25,818
PRISCILLA: Here.

2380
03:32:26,234 --> 03:32:27,484
(DOOR BREAKING)

2381
03:32:29,068 --> 03:32:30,901
- (GUNS FIRING)
- (GASPS)

2382
03:32:39,068 --> 03:32:40,359
- You good?
- Good.

2383
03:32:44,943 --> 03:32:45,943
(GROANS)

2384
03:32:58,109 --> 03:32:59,109
(GUN CLICKS)

2385
03:33:08,318 --> 03:33:09,734
(PANTING)

2386
03:33:13,234 --> 03:33:14,443
(G'IAH GRUNTS)

2387
03:33:40,901 --> 03:33:42,193
{\an8}(SPEAKING FINNISH)

2388
03:34:14,484 --> 03:34:16,109
Let me check I understand this.

2389
03:34:16,193 --> 03:34:18,609
So, a billion dollars
of research and development,

2390
03:34:18,693 --> 03:34:20,693
and all the Widow's Veil can cloak
is your face?

2391
03:34:20,901 --> 03:34:22,026
What about the rest of you?

2392
03:34:22,109 --> 03:34:24,109
That's the newer version, not this one.

2393
03:34:24,234 --> 03:34:26,151
Huh. Never mind.

2394
03:34:26,484 --> 03:34:28,609
(RAP MUSIC PLAYING ON STEREO)

2395
03:34:28,693 --> 03:34:31,193
- This is what we're doing?
- Yes, this is what we're doing.

2396
03:34:31,276 --> 03:34:32,526
Seat belt, please.

2397
03:34:33,151 --> 03:34:34,484
Off we go.

2398
03:34:53,318 --> 03:34:54,693
PRISCILLA: Be careful, G'iah.

2399
03:35:08,984 --> 03:35:11,359
FURY: Why do you think
Rhodey is in charge of this?

2400
03:35:12,193 --> 03:35:14,818
He asked for corroboration
on the New Skrullos site.

2401
03:35:15,526 --> 03:35:16,693
And you gave it to him?

2402
03:35:16,776 --> 03:35:18,026
Yes, Fury.

2403
03:35:18,484 --> 03:35:21,776
In the absence of my scaled superior,
I'm the new head of SIS.

2404
03:35:22,443 --> 03:35:24,776
And last I checked,
Britain and the U.S. were allies.

2405
03:35:24,859 --> 03:35:27,651
Last I checked, Rhodey is a Skrull.

2406
03:35:28,401 --> 03:35:29,401
What?

2407
03:35:29,526 --> 03:35:32,318
(SCOFFS) And you said I'd lost my touch.

2408
03:35:34,109 --> 03:35:36,776
Well, who in the hell
isn't a Skrull these days?

2409
03:35:38,318 --> 03:35:41,234
Why in God's name would Gravik
want to blow up his own people?

2410
03:35:41,318 --> 03:35:42,526
Leverage.

2411
03:35:43,318 --> 03:35:45,734
If I don't give Gravik the Harvest,

2412
03:35:46,193 --> 03:35:50,734
then Rhodey is going to incinerate
the Skrull compound,

2413
03:35:50,818 --> 03:35:53,984
including all the Skrulls
and humans trapped inside.

2414
03:35:54,359 --> 03:35:58,318
Russia will retaliate,
and the world will lose its mind.

2415
03:35:58,609 --> 03:36:02,026
Yes, yes. War, war. But the Harvest?

2416
03:36:02,901 --> 03:36:05,776
Nearly every Avenger spilled blood

2417
03:36:05,859 --> 03:36:08,443
in the Battle of Earth.

2418
03:36:09,526 --> 03:36:10,984
Even Carol Danvers.

2419
03:36:12,526 --> 03:36:16,901
In the aftermath,
some were sent in to collect that DNA.

2420
03:36:19,359 --> 03:36:22,443
Some with the ability to blend in.

2421
03:36:24,568 --> 03:36:28,859
Nobody knew about them
but me and the collectors,

2422
03:36:29,318 --> 03:36:30,651
- led by...
- Gravik.

2423
03:36:30,734 --> 03:36:31,984
Gravik, yes.

2424
03:36:32,068 --> 03:36:35,984
Which is probably where he got the idea
for the Super Skrull machine.

2425
03:36:39,234 --> 03:36:41,984
- So you are responsible for all this?
- Yeah.

2426
03:36:45,568 --> 03:36:47,193
Why do you think I came back?

2427
03:37:09,151 --> 03:37:12,234
A Scandinavian cemetery?
I should've brought my scythe.

2428
03:37:12,818 --> 03:37:16,234
Only dead men keep secrets.
You taught me that, Sonya.

2429
03:37:23,026 --> 03:37:26,151
Fury, why haven't you called
any of your special friends down?

2430
03:37:26,943 --> 03:37:28,651
(SIGHS)

2431
03:37:28,734 --> 03:37:30,234
This is personal.

2432
03:37:31,776 --> 03:37:34,068
We can't keep depending
on these superheroes

2433
03:37:34,151 --> 03:37:36,443
to swoop in and save our asses.

2434
03:37:37,776 --> 03:37:39,859
None of them have lived the life I have.

2435
03:37:40,818 --> 03:37:43,651
None of them can defend the world
the way I can.

2436
03:37:44,818 --> 03:37:47,443
The only power I have

2437
03:37:48,151 --> 03:37:51,068
was planted between my ears
by a single mother,

2438
03:37:52,484 --> 03:37:54,943
and wrapped around my finger by a woman

2439
03:37:55,984 --> 03:37:58,359
who's far greater
than I could ever hope to be.

2440
03:37:59,693 --> 03:38:03,151
If that ain't enough,
then I don't know what hope we have.

2441
03:38:04,818 --> 03:38:08,901
If that ain't enough,
maybe I am just dust.

2442
03:38:11,984 --> 03:38:13,776
Don't you have another one of these?

2443
03:38:13,859 --> 03:38:17,651
I got these all over the place, you know?
Dead men need options.

2444
03:38:19,526 --> 03:38:20,693
Why Finland?

2445
03:38:22,984 --> 03:38:24,818
Priscilla and I honeymooned here.

2446
03:38:27,193 --> 03:38:28,568
Skrulls like the cold.

2447
03:38:39,443 --> 03:38:40,901
Now, you understand.

2448
03:38:47,484 --> 03:38:48,484
(BLOWS)

2449
03:38:48,568 --> 03:38:49,651
(MECHANICAL WHIRRING)

2450
03:38:57,109 --> 03:38:58,234
So, let me clarify.

2451
03:38:58,318 --> 03:39:00,693
You knew how dangerous this vial was,

2452
03:39:00,776 --> 03:39:03,484
so swapped its location
to protect it from Gravik,

2453
03:39:03,734 --> 03:39:05,484
and now you're going to give it to him.

2454
03:39:12,068 --> 03:39:13,526
Exactly.

2455
03:39:14,068 --> 03:39:16,068
Well, they do say Darwin never sleeps.

2456
03:39:16,734 --> 03:39:18,984
Let's give our extinction a nice leg up.

2457
03:39:19,068 --> 03:39:20,109
(CHUCKLES)

2458
03:40:02,693 --> 03:40:03,734
It's time.

2459
03:40:04,151 --> 03:40:05,443
Let's finish this.

2460
03:42:50,837 --> 03:43:02,837
<font color="#00ff00">{\an8}Downloaded From MoviesMod.org</font>

2461
03:42:56,984 --> 03:42:59,359
FURY: This is the promise.

2462
03:42:59,442 --> 03:43:02,525
While you work to keep my home safe,

2463
03:43:03,192 --> 03:43:07,275
<i>Carol Danvers and I
will find you a new one.</i>

2464
03:43:07,942 --> 03:43:12,900
<i>You're tellin' me there's a million
Skrulls walking amongst us right now?</i>

2465
03:43:14,567 --> 03:43:19,067
PAMELA: <i>We need a single commander
whose war power is total and unchecked.</i>

2466
03:43:19,150 --> 03:43:23,317
<i>Therefore, I nominate Gravik
to the post of Skrull General.</i>

2467
03:43:24,859 --> 03:43:27,359
PRISCILLA: <i>Would you have loved me
if I'd never changed?</i>

2468
03:43:28,234 --> 03:43:30,192
<i>If I'd been my true self?</i>

2469
03:43:31,109 --> 03:43:32,109
(FURY SIGHS)

2470
03:43:32,692 --> 03:43:36,942
You had another chance to kill Fury today,
and you didn't take it.

2471
03:43:38,942 --> 03:43:41,234
FURY: <i>What DNA did Gravik steal?</i>

2472
03:43:41,317 --> 03:43:42,525
G'IAH: <i>Only a few samples.</i>

2473
03:43:43,192 --> 03:43:46,650
<i>But he took those because
he couldn't find what he was looking for.</i>

2474
03:43:46,734 --> 03:43:47,900
What was he looking for?

2475
03:43:47,984 --> 03:43:49,817
Something he called "the Harvest."

2476
03:43:49,900 --> 03:43:51,192
I got a deal for you.

2477
03:43:51,275 --> 03:43:54,234
Bring it to me in person,
I'll call the whole thing off.

2478
03:43:54,317 --> 03:43:55,984
And bring some iodide pills.

2479
03:43:56,067 --> 03:43:58,484
The reactor room
can be a touch aggressive.

2480
03:44:15,025 --> 03:44:17,025
(CELL PHONE RINGING)

2481
03:44:23,650 --> 03:44:26,150
This is the first time
you called this number in years.

2482
03:44:26,234 --> 03:44:28,900
I have dialed this number a million times.

2483
03:44:29,609 --> 03:44:32,525
This is just the first time
I pressed send.

2484
03:44:32,609 --> 03:44:35,442
(CHUCKLES) Oh.
Well, that's cold consolation.

2485
03:44:37,442 --> 03:44:39,400
<i>You sound far away. Are you?</i>

2486
03:44:40,275 --> 03:44:44,692
Far enough to where it makes sense
to keep going the way I'm going.

2487
03:44:46,567 --> 03:44:48,442
Know if you'll be coming back?

2488
03:44:50,150 --> 03:44:51,525
(SIGHS)

2489
03:44:51,609 --> 03:44:54,442
Um, I'll, uh... I'll let you go now.

2490
03:44:54,525 --> 03:44:56,984
You don't have to,
if you don't want to, darling.

2491
03:45:01,609 --> 03:45:02,734
Take care of yourself.

2492
03:45:28,109 --> 03:45:29,189
(GUARDS YELLING IN RUSSIAN)

2493
03:45:50,484 --> 03:45:51,900
(GUNSHOTS)

2494
03:48:12,234 --> 03:48:14,150
RHODEY: <i>Mr. President,
we need to stay focused</i>

2495
03:48:14,234 --> 03:48:17,275
on honing your response
to the attack on your motorcade.

2496
03:48:17,359 --> 03:48:19,442
FEMALE ADMIRAL:
Respectfully, we still need time

2497
03:48:19,525 --> 03:48:22,234
to confirm that this was in fact
an official Russian act.

2498
03:48:22,317 --> 03:48:25,650
President Vladimov
has strenuously denied responsibility.

2499
03:48:25,734 --> 03:48:27,054
Oh, he's "strenuously denied it."

2500
03:48:27,109 --> 03:48:28,900
Then I guess we're all right then.

2501
03:48:28,984 --> 03:48:31,150
President Vladimov is a bald-faced liar

2502
03:48:31,234 --> 03:48:33,859
and I've got 30 dead Russians
on a motorway to prove it.

2503
03:48:33,942 --> 03:48:36,984
We cannot rule out the possibility
of a false flag attack.

2504
03:48:37,067 --> 03:48:40,192
Did you take a stupid pill
with your breakfast this morning, Admiral?

2505
03:48:40,275 --> 03:48:43,817
What happened on that motorway
was an all-out assault on our republic,

2506
03:48:43,900 --> 03:48:45,942
orchestrated by the Skrulls
and the Russians

2507
03:48:46,025 --> 03:48:47,775
who are giving them safe haven.

2508
03:48:47,859 --> 03:48:50,817
Our commander-in-chief
is still nursing internal injuries

2509
03:48:50,900 --> 03:48:52,400
from an assassination attempt

2510
03:48:52,484 --> 03:48:54,900
that he barely survived
by the skin of his teeth.

2511
03:48:54,984 --> 03:48:56,775
So, unless you have some actual evidence

2512
03:48:56,859 --> 03:48:59,817
to back up this ridiculous
false flag proposition,

2513
03:48:59,900 --> 03:49:03,525
I suggest you move on to doing
what it is you were summoned here to do,

2514
03:49:03,609 --> 03:49:05,900
which is present
the President of the United States

2515
03:49:05,984 --> 03:49:09,567
with his options
for a military response to Russia.

2516
03:49:09,650 --> 03:49:10,650
(KNOCK ON DOOR)

2517
03:49:15,400 --> 03:49:16,609
(WHISPERS INDISTINCTLY)

2518
03:49:17,234 --> 03:49:18,525
Put it on the monitor.

2519
03:49:21,150 --> 03:49:23,109
What are we looking at here,
Colonel Rhodes?

2520
03:49:23,192 --> 03:49:25,192
Real time satellite imagery, sir,

2521
03:49:25,275 --> 03:49:30,775
this is the Russian tanks taking positions
on the Finland and Ukrainian borders.

2522
03:49:30,859 --> 03:49:32,317
Now, sir, if I may,

2523
03:49:32,400 --> 03:49:33,775
I've taken the liberty

2524
03:49:33,859 --> 03:49:36,900
to prepare a rough copy
of your remarks to the nation.

2525
03:49:37,484 --> 03:49:39,484
The American people
need to hear from you, sir.

2526
03:49:40,400 --> 03:49:41,734
They need your leadership.

2527
03:49:41,817 --> 03:49:44,484
They need to understand
who's responsible for this.

2528
03:49:44,567 --> 03:49:46,775
And it's the Russians, 100%.

2529
03:49:48,025 --> 03:49:49,692
There's your proof right there.

2530
03:49:50,650 --> 03:49:52,150
Make the call, Mr. President.

2531
03:50:06,984 --> 03:50:08,317
(COUGHING)

2532
03:50:23,942 --> 03:50:27,275
- (CONTINUES COUGHING)
- (DEVICE CRACKLES)

2533
03:50:51,692 --> 03:50:53,234
(CONTINUES COUGHING)

2534
03:51:03,692 --> 03:51:05,400
(CELL PHONE RINGING)

2535
03:51:08,109 --> 03:51:09,109
Hello?

2536
03:51:09,192 --> 03:51:11,775
- SONYA: <i>You have to get him out of there.</i>
- Who?

2537
03:51:11,859 --> 03:51:13,609
<i>The President, you bloody idiot.</i>

2538
03:51:13,692 --> 03:51:15,359
<i>Fury's headed straight for you.</i>

2539
03:51:16,942 --> 03:51:21,067
Fury? Why are we concerned about Fury?
We got enough security for him.

2540
03:51:21,150 --> 03:51:23,650
<i>For what? Target practice? Fury's lost it.</i>

2541
03:51:23,734 --> 03:51:25,984
<i>He wants Ritson stopped
before the bomb is launched.</i>

2542
03:51:26,067 --> 03:51:27,734
<i>Move the President now.</i>

2543
03:51:34,609 --> 03:51:36,650
(FURY COUGHING)

2544
03:51:49,525 --> 03:51:52,109
(CONTINUES COUGHING)

2545
03:51:58,900 --> 03:52:00,025
Where is everybody?

2546
03:52:00,609 --> 03:52:01,775
Locked away.

2547
03:52:02,900 --> 03:52:04,817
Looks like it's just you and me, Fury.

2548
03:52:05,400 --> 03:52:07,400
(COUGHING)

2549
03:52:13,067 --> 03:52:15,817
All out of pills?
That's a shame, ain't it?

2550
03:52:15,900 --> 03:52:19,150
No more protection for you.
How about a drink instead?

2551
03:52:21,067 --> 03:52:22,359
Yeah, I wouldn't say no.

2552
03:52:23,442 --> 03:52:24,442
Here.

2553
03:52:27,109 --> 03:52:28,192
There you go.

2554
03:52:29,692 --> 03:52:32,192
To the last stand of the great Nick Fury.

2555
03:52:33,442 --> 03:52:34,442
Rhodey, what are you...

2556
03:52:34,525 --> 03:52:36,484
We're taking you to safety, Mr. President.

2557
03:52:36,567 --> 03:52:38,775
Hey. We're moving the President upstairs.

2558
03:52:38,859 --> 03:52:40,484
- What about the others?
- Clear!

2559
03:52:40,567 --> 03:52:42,167
- Tell 'em to start hunting.
- Copy that.

2560
03:52:43,817 --> 03:52:45,692
<i>Sweep every floor.
Lock down the elevators.</i>

2561
03:52:45,775 --> 03:52:47,275
<i>National security threat.</i>

2562
03:52:48,484 --> 03:52:50,317
(SILENCED GUNSHOTS)

2563
03:52:54,859 --> 03:52:57,525
Bet you never would've thought
your last 20 minutes on Earth

2564
03:52:57,609 --> 03:53:00,192
would be spent down here,
having a drink with me.

2565
03:53:00,275 --> 03:53:02,567
- You see these tremors?
- (BREATHING HEAVILY)

2566
03:53:02,650 --> 03:53:04,775
They're natural at this level of exposure.

2567
03:53:05,567 --> 03:53:07,442
It's once the shaking
gets above the elbow,

2568
03:53:07,525 --> 03:53:10,150
close to the heart,
that's when you need to be concerned.

2569
03:53:10,234 --> 03:53:11,234
I look concerned?

2570
03:53:11,317 --> 03:53:14,692
Of course without the pills,
the symptoms are gonna accelerate.

2571
03:53:14,775 --> 03:53:19,650
Fury, tell me you got a backup plan.
Your little Avengers on standby?

2572
03:53:19,734 --> 03:53:22,150
What about
that invisible cloak and shield?

2573
03:53:22,734 --> 03:53:29,650
(COUGHS) You're too busy playing dress-up,
using my skin like a costume.

2574
03:53:29,734 --> 03:53:32,234
A costume, Fury?
Do you not recognize this skin?

2575
03:53:33,692 --> 03:53:35,609
Huh? This face.

2576
03:53:37,234 --> 03:53:38,984
This was the first human I killed.

2577
03:53:40,275 --> 03:53:41,775
And you know why I killed him?

2578
03:53:41,859 --> 03:53:43,984
I killed him because you told me to.

2579
03:53:45,317 --> 03:53:46,359
Oh, wow.

2580
03:53:47,234 --> 03:53:48,484
You don't even remember.

2581
03:53:49,609 --> 03:53:51,484
The first mission you sent me on.

2582
03:53:52,525 --> 03:53:54,359
You know, I was young. I tried my best.

2583
03:53:54,442 --> 03:53:57,317
I wanted to give everything
to impress my hero.

2584
03:53:58,192 --> 03:54:00,317
You know, the one who promised us a home.

2585
03:54:01,317 --> 03:54:02,650
But this man...

2586
03:54:03,775 --> 03:54:09,692
This man, Fury, he had a wife.
And he had children.

2587
03:54:09,775 --> 03:54:12,442
Yeah, all right,
maybe he was a bit misguided.

2588
03:54:12,525 --> 03:54:15,192
But I killed him because of you.

2589
03:54:16,525 --> 03:54:18,942
I killed him and I killed so many more.

2590
03:54:19,025 --> 03:54:22,859
And everyone I killed
took a little piece out of my heart.

2591
03:54:22,942 --> 03:54:25,067
- Well, you're not the only one.
- No.

2592
03:54:25,150 --> 03:54:28,817
But I am the only one
brave enough to admit it.

2593
03:54:30,025 --> 03:54:31,942
Talos was weak.

2594
03:54:32,359 --> 03:54:37,442
And we wandered in the shadows
for 30 years because he was weak.

2595
03:54:37,525 --> 03:54:41,234
He turned a war people
into a band of beggars and what,

2596
03:54:41,317 --> 03:54:43,359
I'm supposed to emulate that?

2597
03:54:43,984 --> 03:54:47,275
I'm supposed to be like Talos
and put my trust in you?

2598
03:54:47,359 --> 03:54:48,859
You pimped us, Fury.

2599
03:54:48,942 --> 03:54:50,525
You put us out to work for you

2600
03:54:50,609 --> 03:54:52,775
and when you were done with us,
you threw us away.

2601
03:54:52,859 --> 03:54:56,317
So, first, I'm gonna kill you.

2602
03:54:56,400 --> 03:55:00,192
And then I'm gonna take
a flamethrower to humanity.

2603
03:55:00,275 --> 03:55:03,525
And just so I am absolutely clear
about this, Fury...

2604
03:55:03,609 --> 03:55:06,234
You look at me. Look at me.

2605
03:55:06,317 --> 03:55:07,817
You did this.

2606
03:55:07,900 --> 03:55:10,067
All the bombs and the blackouts

2607
03:55:10,150 --> 03:55:12,484
and the massacres and the wildfires

2608
03:55:12,567 --> 03:55:17,525
and the imminent removal of humans
from their habitat, that is all you!

2609
03:55:18,400 --> 03:55:22,525
The species you spent
your entire adult life defending,

2610
03:55:22,609 --> 03:55:23,775
they were condemned to die

2611
03:55:23,859 --> 03:55:26,525
the day I realized
you weren't a man of your word.

2612
03:55:27,817 --> 03:55:32,900
You know, Fury,
you really should've kept your promise.

2613
03:55:32,984 --> 03:55:34,900
You're... You're right.

2614
03:55:37,109 --> 03:55:39,234
You're right, I failed you.

2615
03:55:40,067 --> 03:55:41,067
I failed you.

2616
03:55:41,942 --> 03:55:45,150
I knew within a few years of searching

2617
03:55:45,234 --> 03:55:48,150
that there was no other planet
out there for you.

2618
03:55:49,775 --> 03:55:53,109
I knew the only way
for me to keep my end of the bargain

2619
03:55:53,192 --> 03:55:54,817
was to build you a home here.

2620
03:55:56,275 --> 03:55:57,442
Why didn't you do it?

2621
03:55:58,567 --> 03:56:04,859
Because it's easier to save the lives
of eight billion people

2622
03:56:06,192 --> 03:56:09,484
than it is to change
their hearts and minds.

2623
03:56:11,275 --> 03:56:12,942
Even for Nick Fury?

2624
03:56:13,025 --> 03:56:15,900
Even for Nick Fury.

2625
03:56:22,275 --> 03:56:23,692
And then The Blip came.

2626
03:56:26,442 --> 03:56:27,442
You know,

2627
03:56:28,984 --> 03:56:34,234
the last thing I felt before I flaked off?

2628
03:56:35,109 --> 03:56:36,109
What's that?

2629
03:56:37,025 --> 03:56:38,067
Relief.

2630
03:56:40,525 --> 03:56:43,775
Relief that I didn't have
to fight anymore.

2631
03:56:45,859 --> 03:56:47,817
That I finally had a way out.

2632
03:56:50,317 --> 03:56:51,984
<i>- But you're right...</i>
- Clear the floor.

2633
03:56:52,067 --> 03:56:53,567
- Move! Move!
- Clear the floor.

2634
03:56:53,650 --> 03:56:54,775
Agent, your weapon.

2635
03:56:54,859 --> 03:56:56,275
FURY: <i>I wasn't brave.</i>

2636
03:56:57,192 --> 03:56:59,317
Agent Cannon, floor three, status?

2637
03:57:00,067 --> 03:57:01,400
Agent Cannon?

2638
03:57:01,484 --> 03:57:04,192
FURY: <i>Do you know why
I came back to Earth?</i>

2639
03:57:06,317 --> 03:57:07,317
You.

2640
03:57:08,109 --> 03:57:10,609
You were the youngest Skrull on my team.

2641
03:57:12,317 --> 03:57:14,609
I felt responsible for you.

2642
03:57:14,692 --> 03:57:17,734
Agent Johns, floor two, code four.

2643
03:57:17,817 --> 03:57:21,650
FURY: <i>I should have taught you
that you never give up the fight.</i>

2644
03:57:21,734 --> 03:57:23,109
Move.

2645
03:57:23,192 --> 03:57:24,942
<i>Because I failed you,</i>

2646
03:57:25,025 --> 03:57:27,817
<i>and failed your people,</i>

2647
03:57:27,900 --> 03:57:33,734
I've decided to give you what you want.

2648
03:57:35,109 --> 03:57:36,567
Is that what I think it is?

2649
03:57:37,359 --> 03:57:39,859
Carol Danvers' DNA.

2650
03:57:41,109 --> 03:57:45,817
Along with the Avengers',
that you and your team collected.

2651
03:57:48,692 --> 03:57:50,109
The Harvest.

2652
03:57:51,359 --> 03:57:54,484
In exchange for what?

2653
03:57:54,567 --> 03:57:57,192
That you take it, take your powers,

2654
03:57:57,275 --> 03:58:01,109
go to some other planet,
wipe out some other species,

2655
03:58:01,192 --> 03:58:02,359
I don't give a damn.

2656
03:58:02,442 --> 03:58:07,567
Just leave Earth the hell alone.
And leave it now.

2657
03:58:09,817 --> 03:58:12,609
Call off the strike and save your people.

2658
03:58:13,484 --> 03:58:14,484
GRAVIK: Oh...

2659
03:58:15,025 --> 03:58:16,442
Oh, Fury.

2660
03:58:19,650 --> 03:58:22,442
I think the radiation
is eating your brains, mate.

2661
03:58:24,567 --> 03:58:25,817
(COUGHS)

2662
03:58:38,859 --> 03:58:40,859
(COUGHING)

2663
03:58:57,692 --> 03:58:59,275
- Watch that door.
- AGENT: Yes, sir.

2664
03:59:00,775 --> 03:59:03,192
I need a gun.
Give me your gun, God damn it.

2665
03:59:28,317 --> 03:59:29,734
(COUGHING)

2666
03:59:47,109 --> 03:59:48,234
It's pure.

2667
03:59:49,900 --> 03:59:52,692
- (WHEEZING)
- You really wanna die.

2668
03:59:57,150 --> 03:59:58,692
Okay, we can move him in here.

2669
04:00:01,650 --> 04:00:04,734
No checking behind the doors?
You really are a Skrull.

2670
04:00:05,400 --> 04:00:07,317
Whatever it is you think
you're doing, but...

2671
04:00:07,400 --> 04:00:10,067
No buts.
Just yours back into the hallway. Go on.

2672
04:00:15,400 --> 04:00:19,067
(COUGHING, WHEEZING)

2673
04:00:23,692 --> 04:00:27,734
(GRAVIK AND FURY GROANING)

2674
04:00:32,775 --> 04:00:33,817
What the hell?

2675
04:00:36,775 --> 04:00:39,234
(GROANING CONTINUES)

2676
04:00:45,984 --> 04:00:48,317
(GROANS, COUGHS)

2677
04:00:52,067 --> 04:00:53,067
(GASPS)

2678
04:00:57,025 --> 04:00:58,359
(GRUNTING)

2679
04:01:12,775 --> 04:01:13,775
(GROANS)

2680
04:01:18,984 --> 04:01:20,984
(GROANING)

2681
04:01:23,650 --> 04:01:24,650
You.

2682
04:01:29,859 --> 04:01:31,942
- (SILENCED GUNSHOTS)
- (BODY THUDS)

2683
04:01:37,192 --> 04:01:39,400
You might wanna aim that gun
to your left, sir.

2684
04:01:39,484 --> 04:01:41,400
Shoot him right now, Mr. President.

2685
04:01:41,484 --> 04:01:44,984
I'm not here to hurt you, sir. But he is.

2686
04:01:45,067 --> 04:01:46,234
Rhodey?

2687
04:01:47,900 --> 04:01:51,567
You killed my mother. My father.

2688
04:01:51,650 --> 04:01:53,775
(GRAVIK GRUNTS)

2689
04:01:57,275 --> 04:02:00,484
You're flailing. You're weak.

2690
04:02:06,067 --> 04:02:07,525
(STRAINING)

2691
04:02:23,734 --> 04:02:24,734
(GRUNTS)

2692
04:02:31,150 --> 04:02:32,150
(GRUNTS)

2693
04:02:32,775 --> 04:02:34,609
FURY: He is a Skrull.

2694
04:02:35,400 --> 04:02:36,984
And if you don't call off the strike,

2695
04:02:37,067 --> 04:02:39,234
you're going to kill the man
he's replicating

2696
04:02:39,317 --> 04:02:41,734
along with some
of the world's greatest minds.

2697
04:02:42,400 --> 04:02:44,609
Wait. What?

2698
04:02:44,692 --> 04:02:48,150
Skrull rebels have kidnapped
dozens of world officials.

2699
04:02:48,984 --> 04:02:51,109
Along with Colonel Rhodes.

2700
04:02:51,775 --> 04:02:54,359
He and other world officials

2701
04:02:54,442 --> 04:02:57,942
are being kept in pods
beneath the Skrull compound.

2702
04:02:58,025 --> 04:03:00,775
You nuke that, you nuke them.

2703
04:03:01,900 --> 04:03:03,359
Please tell me this isn't true.

2704
04:03:03,442 --> 04:03:06,442
Are you listening to this insanity?
Of course it isn't true.

2705
04:03:06,859 --> 04:03:08,859
(BOTH GRUNTING)

2706
04:03:19,817 --> 04:03:20,817
(GROANS)

2707
04:03:22,817 --> 04:03:24,234
Mr. President, listen.

2708
04:03:24,317 --> 04:03:28,275
Just stay the course, all right?
And all our enemies will be gone.

2709
04:03:28,359 --> 04:03:29,400
(HESITATES) Yeah.

2710
04:03:41,234 --> 04:03:42,754
RHODEY: Mr. President, listen to me...

2711
04:03:42,817 --> 04:03:45,525
Sir, you're looking at your enemy.

2712
04:03:45,609 --> 04:03:50,359
You wait another minute,
he and the rebel Skrulls will win.

2713
04:03:52,400 --> 04:03:54,400
(GROANS)

2714
04:04:01,775 --> 04:04:02,775
(BOTH GRUNTING)

2715
04:04:15,067 --> 04:04:16,359
(CHOKING)

2716
04:04:18,442 --> 04:04:19,984
(GRAVIK GRUNTING)

2717
04:04:25,359 --> 04:04:26,734
G'IAH: Sleep.

2718
04:04:36,067 --> 04:04:38,567
For Christ's sake, Ritson,
what have you got to lose?

2719
04:04:38,650 --> 04:04:41,734
FURY: She's right.
Just delay the strike.

2720
04:04:41,817 --> 04:04:46,192
If I'm wrong, you can send me
to prison and flatten Russia.

2721
04:04:48,984 --> 04:04:50,192
(G'IAH GRUNTS)

2722
04:04:53,484 --> 04:04:54,484
(GRUNTS)

2723
04:04:57,775 --> 04:04:58,775
(GRAVIK GRUNTS)

2724
04:05:15,317 --> 04:05:17,567
You're just like your father.

2725
04:05:18,234 --> 04:05:20,275
- Just like them.
- (G'IAH GRUNTS)

2726
04:05:22,567 --> 04:05:24,150
(GROANS)

2727
04:05:50,150 --> 04:05:52,150
(PANTING) Jesus,
somebody give me the phone.

2728
04:06:34,025 --> 04:06:35,359
(PANTING)

2729
04:06:39,817 --> 04:06:41,067
Colonel Rhodes?

2730
04:06:44,109 --> 04:06:45,567
How long have you been in here?

2731
04:06:47,150 --> 04:06:49,442
Whoa! Colonel Rhodes, I've got you.

2732
04:06:52,734 --> 04:06:55,525
You've been held hostage
for a long time.

2733
04:06:55,900 --> 04:06:56,900
(GROANS)

2734
04:07:26,817 --> 04:07:28,650
RITSON: <i>We all witnessed the terror attack</i>

2735
04:07:28,734 --> 04:07:32,192
<i>that was carried out on my motorcade
earlier this week in England.</i>

2736
04:07:32,275 --> 04:07:34,067
<i>The terrorists responsible</i>

2737
04:07:34,150 --> 04:07:37,942
<i>were a shape-shifting alien-born species
known as Skrulls.</i>

2738
04:07:38,567 --> 04:07:40,900
{\an8}That is why tonight
I'm presenting to Congress,

2739
04:07:40,984 --> 04:07:42,650
{\an8}for immediate emergency authorization,

2740
04:07:42,734 --> 04:07:46,775
{\an8}a bill that designates all off-world born
species enemy combatants.

2741
04:07:47,442 --> 04:07:51,067
We know who you are.
We know how to find you.

2742
04:07:52,192 --> 04:07:54,359
And we will kill every last one of you.

2743
04:08:08,109 --> 04:08:09,984
Love what you've done with the place.

2744
04:08:14,359 --> 04:08:15,400
I'm sorry.

2745
04:08:15,942 --> 04:08:16,942
For what?

2746
04:08:18,192 --> 04:08:19,275
Not being here.

2747
04:08:19,859 --> 04:08:22,025
(SCOFFS) I can take care of myself.

2748
04:08:22,109 --> 04:08:25,317
I know that. But you shouldn't have to.

2749
04:08:25,900 --> 04:08:26,942
(SCOFFS)

2750
04:08:27,359 --> 04:08:30,275
I... I know who I am when you're not here.

2751
04:08:31,400 --> 04:08:33,234
It's when you come back

2752
04:08:34,484 --> 04:08:35,775
that I start to wonder...

2753
04:08:37,567 --> 04:08:39,359
Did you fall in love with me?

2754
04:08:40,900 --> 04:08:42,692
Or the face that puts you at ease?

2755
04:08:44,609 --> 04:08:48,734
I love you, Priscilla.

2756
04:08:49,984 --> 04:08:53,817
I'm here to ask you for one last chance.

2757
04:08:55,442 --> 04:08:56,484
I'm leaving tonight.

2758
04:08:58,484 --> 04:09:00,150
Then I guess this is goodbye.

2759
04:09:05,734 --> 04:09:10,650
If you can find a way to forgive me,
you know where to find me.

2760
04:09:34,400 --> 04:09:35,525
We meet at last.

2761
04:09:38,567 --> 04:09:41,025
Unless you have an army
crammed in the back of that car,

2762
04:09:41,109 --> 04:09:42,710
I advise you to go back the way you came.

2763
04:09:42,734 --> 04:09:44,442
Oh, I haven't come for fight, G'iah.

2764
04:09:45,400 --> 04:09:48,359
With your special abilities,
it would be a lopsided affair.

2765
04:09:49,275 --> 04:09:50,275
Who are you?

2766
04:09:50,359 --> 04:09:53,234
A friend of a friend.
Your people need a leader.

2767
04:09:54,317 --> 04:09:57,942
You'll need resources to fight this war
that Ritson has launched on your people

2768
04:09:58,025 --> 04:09:59,192
and I can get them to you.

2769
04:09:59,275 --> 04:10:02,067
And let me guess, you're doing this
out of the kindness of your heart?

2770
04:10:02,150 --> 04:10:03,859
(CHUCKLES) Oh, God, no, don't be silly.

2771
04:10:03,942 --> 04:10:07,775
My father entered into a deal like that.
It didn't end so well.

2772
04:10:07,859 --> 04:10:10,942
Yes, let's be sure not to repeat
the mistakes of Talos and Fury

2773
04:10:11,025 --> 04:10:12,859
and leave love and friendship out of this.

2774
04:10:12,942 --> 04:10:15,859
I will use you and you will use me

2775
04:10:15,942 --> 04:10:19,192
and together we'll make this planet safe
for both our people.

2776
04:10:43,525 --> 04:10:44,692
(PHONE RINGING)

2777
04:10:47,275 --> 04:10:49,484
I was relieved that we made it out alive.

2778
04:10:49,567 --> 04:10:50,859
FURY: <i>I was relieved, too.</i>

2779
04:10:50,942 --> 04:10:53,775
Until I watched
that hateful-ass speech you made.

2780
04:10:55,400 --> 04:10:59,109
<i>Putting things back together
was never gonna be easy.</i>

2781
04:10:59,192 --> 04:11:00,525
AGENT: What the hell is all this?

2782
04:11:01,900 --> 04:11:04,650
This is how the enemy got so good.

2783
04:11:08,317 --> 04:11:11,984
FURY: <i>You took a bad situation
and made it worse.</i>

2784
04:11:12,067 --> 04:11:14,984
<i>That's real one-term-President stuff.</i>

2785
04:11:16,275 --> 04:11:18,317
<i>But we have to act now.</i>

2786
04:11:19,775 --> 04:11:21,400
<i>Before the hit squads you inspired</i>

2787
04:11:21,484 --> 04:11:24,525
<i>kill off the Skrulls
who still wanna help us.</i>

2788
04:11:26,734 --> 04:11:28,025
- (PEOPLE SCREAMING)
- (GUNSHOTS)

2789
04:11:28,109 --> 04:11:31,942
FURY: <i>Now you've got dumbass vigilantes
killing innocent humans, too.</i>

2790
04:11:34,817 --> 04:11:36,859
<i>When they're not getting
killed themselves.</i>

2791
04:11:42,109 --> 04:11:43,567
<i>Call off your war.</i>

2792
04:11:43,650 --> 04:11:46,942
RITSON: <i>Give me a break.
There's only one way this ends.</i>

2793
04:11:47,025 --> 04:11:48,942
<i>The old Nick Fury would have known that.</i>

2794
04:11:49,025 --> 04:11:53,692
And if you truly care about the Skrulls,
get 'em off my planet.

2795
04:12:24,567 --> 04:12:26,317
(SIGHS) Hold a minute.

2796
04:12:54,067 --> 04:12:58,484
Sounds like peace, doesn't it?

2797
04:12:58,567 --> 04:13:00,984
Yeah. That's all I want.

2798
04:13:03,442 --> 04:13:05,817
- Priscilla...
- Varra.

2799
04:13:06,775 --> 04:13:10,942
Now that humans know we're among them,
I'd like to use my birth name.

2800
04:13:11,942 --> 04:13:16,150
Well, Varra. Good news from S.A.B.E.R.

2801
04:13:16,234 --> 04:13:20,359
The Kree said they are open to peace talks
with the Skrulls.

2802
04:13:21,609 --> 04:13:22,817
The Kree make peace.

2803
04:13:24,067 --> 04:13:26,734
Reminds me of that old joke.

2804
04:13:26,817 --> 04:13:28,775
What do Skrulls call good luck?

2805
04:13:30,025 --> 04:13:31,025
Bad luck.

2806
04:13:31,109 --> 04:13:33,442
- Stop it. It's a good thing.
- (CHUCKLES)

2807
04:13:35,025 --> 04:13:37,025
- I need your help.
- My help?

2808
04:13:37,109 --> 04:13:39,900
Yeah, with this, you know,
this peace summit.

2809
04:13:41,567 --> 04:13:45,234
You're the best diplomat
the Skrulls have ever had.

2810
04:13:46,567 --> 04:13:48,317
I'm no good with people. You are.

2811
04:13:48,400 --> 04:13:51,359
- You've got your own way.
- Yeah, well, I'm sick of it.

2812
04:13:52,109 --> 04:13:53,525
And we're better together.

2813
04:13:54,859 --> 04:13:56,234
Well, at least, I am.

2814
04:13:59,525 --> 04:14:02,150
Please, come with me.

2815
04:14:10,525 --> 04:14:12,025
VARRA: I'll help you get started.

2816
04:14:13,109 --> 04:14:14,734
But then I've gotta get back.

2817
04:14:14,817 --> 04:14:17,442
All my work is here, darling.

2818
04:14:17,525 --> 04:14:19,692
And it's never been more important.

2819
04:14:33,442 --> 04:14:35,234
I just wanted to tell you that...

2820
04:14:36,650 --> 04:14:37,775
That I love you.

2821
04:14:39,109 --> 04:14:40,900
As I am.

2822
04:14:47,150 --> 04:14:49,984
Only as you are.

